        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"new\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f195\" role=\"img\" title=\"new\">:new:</span> <strong>New project intention</strong> · <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/project-intentions/issues/14\">#14 Deitmar's and Toën-Vaquié's theories of the field with one element</a></p>\n<p>The goal of this project it to formalize Deitmar's and Toën-Vaquié's approaches to the field with one element, with the final goal of proving that those are equivalent. We will follow Vezzani's <a href=\"https://rdcu.be/frfIZ\">paper</a> Deitmar’s versus Toën-Vaquié’s schemes over <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{\\mathbb{F}_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>\n<p>Registered by <strong>@riccardobrasca</strong> · expires <strong>Dec 27, 2026</strong><br>\nAreas: <code>t-algebra</code></p>",
